      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks! that's a good start. it's definitely professional.\n\nbut can we make it a little more... i don't know, evocative? like, instead of just saying \"shipping hiccups,\" can you describe the chaos of a big warehouse in a way that feels a bit more vivid? like, instead of just being a mistake, make it sound like the warehouse is just one of those places where things go haywire for really strange, unpredictable reasons. like there's a bit of an unpredictable energy or something happening behind the scenes that's just totally out of our hands. keep it high-end, obviously, but give it some more flavor.",
      "source": "evaluator"
